<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="TVM5.10.1">
<l>piṟanta vāṟum vaḷarnta vāṟum periya pārataṅ kaicey taivarkkut</l>
<l>tiṟaṅkaḷ cāṭṭi  yiṭṭuc ceytu pōṉa māyaṅkaḷum</l>
<l>niṟanta ṉūṭupuk keṉatāviyai niṉṟuniṉ ṟurukki yuṇkiṉṟavic</l>
<l>ciṟanta vāṉcuṭa rēyuṉṉai yeṉṟukol cērvatuvē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>O this superior bright glow that,</l>
<l>with the way [you] were born, the way [you] grew up and [your] miraculous deeds</l>
<l>in which you acted [and] went, assigning [your] powers to the Five, acting in the great Bhārata [war],</l>
<l>constantly, constantly melts my soul, entering right into the vital spot, [and] consumes [it],</l>
	<l>when will there be joining you?</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
